        <mxCell id="header-sub" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1e293b&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;What happens, in order, when a dev creates a project on AWS and deploys an app into it?&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;Scope: CMP backend, Terraform in the CMP pod, cnp-projects registry, Argo CD, EKS · GCP works the same · main as of 2026-10-29&lt;br&gt;Sources: CMP routers/projects.py, deployments.py, services/project_*.py · app-templates · K3s applicationset-*.yaml&lt;br&gt;Out of scope: image build · Image Updater · state check (see cmp-cloud-read) · user path to the app (see app-runtime)&lt;br&gt;Gaps: G7 the CMP API does not check the JWT audience · G18 deleting a cloud Application while its cluster is down hangs on the finalizer&lt;br&gt;v0.1 · source: cnp-docs/architecture/cnp&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#475569;" vertex="1" parent="1">
